    "title": "Minimal Watch Face",
    "description": "Discover the ultimate fusion of style and functionality with Galaxy Design Watch Faces: https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=7591577949235873920\r\n\r\nIntroducing Minimal Watch Face by Galaxy Design for Wear OS, where simplicity meets sophistication. Elevate your timekeeping experience with our sleek analog watch face that boasts a range of cutting-edge features:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd52 Minimal Design: Embrace the essence of elegance with our clean and understated design that exudes timeless style.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 10x Colors: Customize your watch face to suit your mood and style with a palette of seven vibrant colors, ensuring your watch always complements your look.\r\n\r\n\u231a 2x Hand: Effortlessly keep track of hours and minutes with our two-hand display, offering clarity and precision at a glance.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Rotating Date: Stay organized and never miss an important date with our rotating date feature, seamlessly integrated into the watch face for convenience.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0b AOD Mode: Extend the battery life of your device without sacrificing style or functionality, thanks to our ambient mode that keeps you connected while conserving power.\r\n\r\nExperience the perfect blend of form and function with Minimal Watch Face by Galaxy Design. Elevate your watch game and make a statement wherever you go. Download it now!\r\n\r\nSUPPORTED DEVICES:\r\n-\u2003Google Pixel Watch\r\n-\u2003Google Pixel Watch 2\r\n-\u2003Samsung Galaxy Watch 4\r\n-\u2003Samsung Galaxy Watch 4 Classic\r\n-\u2003Samsung Galaxy Watch 5\r\n-\u2003Samsung Galaxy Watch 5 Pro\r\n-\u2003Samsung Galaxy Watch 6\r\n-\u2003Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 Classic\r\nAnd All Smart Watch with Wear OS 3 and later",
